-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">사업목적</span></b></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 30pt; text-indent: -30pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;◦ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">지역 주력 산업 혁신 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">경상북도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">구미시 등 국내 제조업의 디지털 전환과 첨단기술 적용을 통한 제조 혁신 실현</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 30pt; text-indent: -30pt;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;◦ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">DX </span><span style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">AX </span><span style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">생태계 조성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">제조업의 생산성 증대를 위한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -30pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">HPC </span><span 