ans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">구미</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">김천</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">칠곡 우대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 24.5pt; text-indent: -24.5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 24.5pt; text-indent: -24.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; text-indent: -24.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-indent: -24.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-indent: -24.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">지원기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-indent: -24.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">2025. 09 ~ 2026. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">01</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 24.5pt; text-indent: -24.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; text-indent: -24.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\