amily: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">반도체</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">방산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">기계</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">소재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">로봇 등 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">M&amp;S(Modeling and Simulation) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">기술자문</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;• </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">시뮬레이션과 데이터 분석으로 신제품 설계 및 공정 최적화 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">제조분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">DX(Digital Transformation) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">전환을 위한 기술자문</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;• </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">제품의 품질 검사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">불량 원인을 분석 등 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">기타 슈퍼컴퓨터를 활용한 기업 지원 및 컨설팅</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;• </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">기업 수요에 기반한 슈퍼컴퓨팅 활용 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -28.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -28.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">필수사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -28.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -28.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">기술자문은 슈퍼컴퓨터를 활용하여 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.2pt; text-indent: -28.2pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -28.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.4pt; text-indent: -28.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">신청 및 문의</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.4pt; text-indent: -28.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; text-indent: -109.867px;\">&nbsp;◦ 신청</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; text-indent: -109.867px;\">기간: 지원기간 내 상시접수&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.4pt; text-indent: -28.4pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;◦ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: e-mail </span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">또는 방문 접수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 28.4pt; text-indent: -28.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; text-indent: -109.867px;\">&nbsp;◦ 제출서류: 슈퍼컴퓨팅 기술지원 요청서, 슈퍼컴퓨팅 전문가 자문 계획서, 전문가 이력서 각 1부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 82.4pt; text-indent: -82.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; - e-mail </span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: yis0809@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 82.4pt; text-indent: -82.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">방문 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">경북 구미시 대학로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">61, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">산학협력관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">505</span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">호</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -82.4pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">054-478-6783)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 3em; text-indent: -82.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -82.4pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 82.4pt; text-indent: -82.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; fon